<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Timoti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Timoti yo, na Pol, pepa magigl i, ene bogl teiga. Na moglka i, God yene wakai prumere na Jisas dedugwa yoba ta moratnedi na kere idre, te, Krais Jisas pre mediglbi, ka kaima aimadi kamin kor moraiglme dugwa i, yoba di tenatnedi na kere yugwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Timoti yo, ene na wana mere yegl moglsre, dena muduna suna motnga. Na prika i, Neno Kade God ya nono Yaglno Kade Krais Jisas, ye ene mitn goglsre, ene yoko kaima ere wakai ere tedre, den mudn wida di padigl tenabredi prika.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti kudugl goglkre, God kogonmo ere pai morabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Ana na God kogonmo ere moglmara i, na etne ya eduer, ene pre ege ege poglo di prisre, God di wakai yei te, kamage ere moglka. Na kowanoma awanoma okna ibo God kogonmo ersre, aglau ta erekrumnedi primere mere yegl, na ama God kogonmo erika i, aglau ta erekriedi prika. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ene okna kai etnga i, na poglo di prisre, ene pre kamage ere, ene ka kaima kanagledi prika. Na prika i, na ene kanibo, gun podo yenagledi prika. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Te, ene siragl mere God kamo kaima pre mediglnga i, poglo di prika igne, na kaima ene kanagledi prika. Te, na pre gi diga i, ene abu awan Lois ya ene man Yunis komono kana pre mediurko, ye pre mediurere yegl, ene ama yegl pre mediglnedi prika.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Yegl pre na ene di tebo, ene kor poglo di pratnedi prika i, okna na ogona bitn mina yeigo, God ere mogl kogon ta eratnedi ye yobuglo bogl togwa i, ye yobuglomo i u podo enabedi ero. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Te, ene God kogonmo eratnga i, kudugl goglkro! I siragl pre God ye Murubuglomo norukwa suna moglkwa i, nono kudugl goraiglmedi erekrukwa. Ye erukwa i, yobuglo norsre, nono deno muduno ikne ikne tenaiglmedi ersre, nomane wakai norukwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Yegl erukwa pre ene kudugl goratnga i, kuno ta erekrukwa. Ene Yaglno Kade kamo di nogugl edinatnga i, agai goglkro! Te, na Yagl Kade pre kane paiga i, ama againa goglkro! Ene agai ta goglkratnga ba ene God yobuglomo idre, Jisas kamo wakai i pre na yubun imere yegl, ene ama yubun yegl inatnga paugwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Ana God moglkwa i, ye nono ere idre, nono ye yobama kaima moraiglmedi agle dugo, ede suna umga. Ye nono ere yugwa i, nono kogon wakai ta erumga pre nono ere ikrukwa ba yene wakai prisre, ere wakai ere noragledi prumere nono ere yugwa. God ye nono yegl mere ere wakai ere norukwa i, ye okna ibo, taragl swara ta ere yeikrukwa igne, Krais Jisas mina ere wakai ere noragledi di padigl kodugwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Okna ibo di padigl kodugwa ba nono Ere Yugwa Yagle Jisas Krais umara i mina God ye siragl mere nono ere wakai ere norukwa i, ede nogugl ugwa. Jisas ye yene geglkwa mabuno si dudidre, te, kor meglkwa mabuno ya yoba aimadi kamin wakai moraiglkwa i, ye kamo wakai i mina i nogugl edugwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Te, na moglka i, na Jisas kamo wakai i, yoba di nogugl ede tenatnedi God kogon narsre, Jisas dedugwa yoba ta ama moratnedi kere yugwa. Ye kogon yegl narsre, ye kamo yoba beke tenatnedi kogon narukwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Ana God kogon yegl narukwa pre na yubun tau mere iga, ba na agai ta goglkrika. I siragl pre na yoba swara ta pre mediglka i, pre kan ere kodiga. Te, na pre gi diga i, na taragl ta ye ogo mina yeiga i, ye wakai ere sugl mogl enan, na okuo ye kanaglka igne, inaglka kuno erumedi prika.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Na okna God kamo pamere ene beke teiga i, ene pre moglsre, na ene beke teimere kuno yegl, ene yoba beke tenatnga paugwa. Te, ene yoba ka beke tenatnga igne, ene den mudn Krais Jisas tedre, ye pre medigl moglsre, ye kamo yoba beke tenatnedi prika. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />God kamo wakai kaima yogwa i, ene sugl wakai moratnedi togwa pre Mudu Murubuglo ene yobuglo bogl tenan, ene sugl wakai moglo. <verse eid="2TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Ana ene pitnga, yoba mudu provins Esia suna meglkwa i, na kide kodigwa. Ye mudu na kide kodigo, te yagl suo Figelus ya Hermogenes ye ama na kide kodibrika.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Yoba mudu i, na kide kodigwa ba na prika i, yagl Onesiforus yobama bogl meglkwa i, God ye mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere tenabedi prika. I siragl pre Onesiforus ye ege mere na dena muduna si gigledi narukwa. Ye na kane paiga i pre againa goglkrukwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ye ede Rom ugwa igne i ye yobuglo ere, na doko pi, kane paimara na kanugwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Yegl pre na Yagl Kade agle di prika i, okuo ye gumuglo mina adigl moramga igne i Yagl Kade ye Onesiforus mirie goglsre, ere wakai ere tenabedi ye agle di prika. Okna, na dumo Efesus moglka igne, Onesiforus ama kogon kane kane ersre, na ake ple di narukwa i, enene pitnga.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Timoti adigl gigledi morabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Wana yo, Krais Jisas nono yoko kaima ere wakai ere norumara i mina ene yobuglo idre, adigl gigledi moratnga paugwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ene adigl gigledi moglsre, na okna dumo tau yoba mere kide gumuglnomugl na ka siragl mere yoba beke teigo, ene pitnga ka ikra ene pitnga pre ene motnara yagl tau adigl gigledi moraiglkwa i, ka i beke ten, ye yoba tau mere ama beke tenaiglkwa.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Ana ene kogonen yegl paugwa pre ene Jisas Krais kogonmo eratnga i, soldia erimere mere yegl ersre, yubun tau ama inatnga paugwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Soldia meglkwa i, kuda ta paugwa igne, ye kuda swara i we di prikwa. Ye yene ame wakai dinaiglkwa i pre yene kogono ama ta eribi, wagamage panabuka ba ye yegl ta erekrikwa. I siragl pre ye soldia moraiglmedi ye i suna edugwa yagl i, wakai prabedi prikwa pre soldia kogon swara i erikwa.<verse eid="2TI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Te, yoba resis erikwa i, ene ama pro! Resis i, lomo ama paugwa. Ye lo i ta duglo boglkribi, prais ta ikraiglkwa ba ye resis lomo duglo boglsre keme prais inaiglkwa.<verse eid="2TI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Te, yoba ta kogon podo ersre, kaya mokna ere yagl, sugl ere, erikwa i, ye kogon podo erikwa pre ye kaya mokna ere yaiglmara i, yene komono kana si nenaiglkwa paugwa. Ye si nebi, yoba tau okuo nenaiglkwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Na kogon pre ka magigl diga i, ene kinan gudu pro. Kinan gudu pitn, Yagl Kade ene ka mudu i, pre pogl sinatnedi erabuka.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Ana na ka wakai yoba di te wan moglka igne, na Jisas Krais, Devit gawamo moglkwa i, goglsre, adigl u kor omiwe di, yoba yegl di te wan moglka. Ka i, ene pre moglo. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Na ka wakai yegl di wan moglka i pre yoba na kide erumedi kandre, yubun nare, ama sen mina na si kane sigwa. Ye na si kane sigwa ba God kamo i ta si kane sikrikwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Yegl pre God yobama, ye kere i pere edugwa i, na ake ple di tenagledi yubun kane kane iga. I siragl pre na prika i, na ye ake ple di tebo, Krais Jisas ye wakai moraiglmedi ere inan, ye abuglagemo mina aimadi kamin wakai kaima moraiglmedi prika.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Na ka ta borarika magigl i, ka kaima paugwa pre nono pre medramga paugwa. Ka i yegl paugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Nono Krais bogl akie gunga pre ye bogl akie ama kor moramga.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Te, nono yubun idre, adigl gigledi mun, nono ye bogl akie king moramga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ba nono ye mokono tomun, ye ama moko norabuka.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Nono pre medigl moglkrumun, ye ka dumara adigl mogl pai morabuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">I siragl pre ye yene ka dumara adigl moglkrabuka i, kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti ye God kogonmo yoba wakai ta morabuka paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Timoti yo, ka magigl i ene yobanma poglo di praiglmedi ero. Ersre, God gumuglo mina ye ama ka gigledi di te, ka kebra kebra mina ka drano dikrio do. I siragl pre ka kebra mina ka drano dibi, ene ake ple di tekrabuka ba yoba pre meglkwa i, ere kide ere tenabuka.<verse eid="2TI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Timoti yo, ene kogon eratnara i, God wakai kanabedi ye kamo wakai ere bekenatnga! Ene yegl etn, ene God kamo, kaima paugwa i, kuno ere yoba di tedre, agai ta goglkratnga paugwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16-17" />Ba yoba tau God mokono tedre, ka mem wakai ta paikrumara dinaiglkwa i, ene ye dinaiglmara suna moglkro. I siragl pre ye ka digwa i, num kide ta de ede u podo omere mere yegl, ye ka dimara i ede u podo enabuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 2:16-17">Ana na yoba tau ka mem wakai ta paikrukwa dime diga i, yagl suo Himeneus ya Filetus ama ka yegl mere dibrika. <verse eid="2TI 2:16-17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Yagl suo i ye ka kaima paugwa i kide kodidre, yoba adigl u kor enaiglkwa igne i plau di kodume dibrika. Ye yegl dibrara i mina pre mediglkwa yoba tau prisre, kinano suo yogo, ye kaima dibredi prikwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Mabuno yegl paugwa ba God ye yugu ta kenagledi kobuglo ta makandigle bogl paduglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Kobuglo i mina ye ka ta yegl bogl paduglkwa, Yoba ira ta ye Yagl Kade yobama meglkwa i, Yagl Kade yene pre kan erumiwe di, yegl boglkwa. Te, ye ka ta ama boglkwa i, yegl paugwa, Yoba ta ye Yagl Kade yobamo ta mole dinabuka i, ye mabuno kide moko tenabuka pamiwe di, kobuglo i mina ka yegl ama boglkwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Ana yoba kade ta yugumo yomara yugugl i, sin ya dis kwi mere yogwa. Tau gol ya silva mina bekigwa yogo, tau ama makan koglwa ya ede mina bekigwa yogwa. Ana dis tau, kogon wakai pre yogo, tau kogon kide pre yogwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Gold and silver objects" file="hk00143b.tif" size="col" loc="2.20" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="2.20" /> <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Yegl pre ene pro. Yoba ta mabuno kide ere dinagledi erabuka i, ye dis ta kogonmo wakai paugwa mere yegl morabuka. Yagl Kade ye na kogona erabedi i pere edenan, ye kogon wakai kane kane erabuka i, kuno erabuka.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Ana mabuno kide tau gakamugl deno muduno mina pogglau boglkwa i, ene ere dinagledi teke ede eglke po. Ba ene mabuno du ya God kamo pre mediglnga mabuno i ya, yoba pere den mudn tenatnga mabuno i ya te, yoba pere bogl akie wakai moraiglkwa mabuno i, ene eragledi ero. Te, na ene swara mabuno wakai yegl eratnga i pre ta dikrika ba yoba ira ta ye deno muduno bogl God agle dinaiglkwa yobamo ta moraiglkwa i, ene ye bogl akie mabuno wakai eramnedi eraiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="2TI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Ene mabuno wakai yegl eragledi eratnga ba yoba ka kane kane, mem wakai ta paikrukwa dinaiglmara i, kigl nonga plau dinabuka pre ene ye bogl akie ka dikrio. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Yagl Kade niglmo kogonmo yoba ta moraiglkwa i, ye yoba pere bogl kigl nonga dikraiglkwa paugwa. Te, yoba ta ye ere kide ere tebi, ye deno tabre kubro tekraiglkwa paugwa ba ye yoba mudu ere wakai ere tedre, God kamo siragl mere yoba beke tenaiglkwa i yene pre pogl sidre, beke tenaiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="2TI 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Te, ye mogl atne edidre, yoba ta ye kudano ikne mere yegl moraiglkwa i, ka beke tenaiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre God yoba i agai tenan, ye nomano yake tedre, ka kaima paugwa i pre pogl sinaiglmo mo sikraiglmo mo i, nono ta prikrumga pre God kogonmo yoba ye yoba i ka beke tenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Yoba ta kudano ikne mere yegl meglkwa i, yagl kide kigln koglmara sigo, yagl kide prumere eraiglmedi ye si kane sugwa ba yoba i nomane idre, aglau erumiwedi pre, teke ede meda enaiglkwa i, wakai panabuka.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Okuo kaima ime, siragl taragl plau dinabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Te, ene ama pre pogl sinatnga i, okuo ibor ege kide ta unabuka. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ege i unan, yoba ye yene wakai kandre, mige moni ama wakai kandre, ye yene pre i mitna ede, kagno ake mitna edenaiglkwa. Yoba yegl mere ersre, te, ye yoba pere ka kide di tedre, neno mano kano prikre, yoba ye wakai ere tenaiglkwa i di wakai yei tekre, ama God mokono tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Yoba okuo yegl mere ersre, ama ye yoba pere deno muduno tekre, yoba ye aglau ere tenaiglkwa i kide kodokre, yoba pere kenaglno sinaiglkwa. Ye yegl ersre, te mabuno kide ye deno muduno mina pogglau borabuka i mane dikre, yoba ere sidre, mabuno wakai kide yomedi kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Yoba mabuno yegl ersre, te ye ama yoba pere i pi kudano ikne ogono mina yedre, mabuno gua gua tabre ersre, mogl mitna kaima edumnedi praiglkwa. Te, ye ama God wakai kanaiglkwa i kankre, ye erme gun yenaiglkwa i keme wakai praiglkwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Ye ka mabuno prumnedi eraiglkwa ba God ye meglmara kogon yobuglo erabuka i, ye mane dinaiglkwa. Yoba yegl mere ta moraiglmara i, ene mogl eglke edo!<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Ana yoba tau mabuno kide yegl ere meglkwa i, ye yoba kipaimara teke konbo ede suna udre, abu tau nomano gigle dikrukwa meglkwa i, bakagl tedre, si kane sigwa mere yegl paugwa. Ana abu wagle i, nomano gigle dikrukwa. Nomano gigle dikruko, tadaglme ye meglmara kau sugo, taragl kane kane ye deno muduno mina pogglau boglkwa i ye ama duglo beglkwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Te, ye ege ege ka bekenamnedi erikwa ba ka kaima paugwa i, ye pre pogl sinaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="2TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Moses before Pharoah" file="FM 069 Moses before Pharoah_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="3.8">Kumo giai yagl suo Janes ya Jambres</figure>Okna ibo, yagl suo kagno Janes ya Jambres ye Moses kudamo ikne moglsre, Moses kogonmo si kegl dinabugledi eribrere mere yegl, yoba kide tau erme meglkwa i, God kamo kaima paugwa i ama si kegl dinamnedi erikwa. Yoba i, ye nomano u kide ogo, ye God kamo wakai yogwa i mina ede eglke pi kodigwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ba ene pro! Yoba ka mabuno kibi didre, yoba bakagl teigwa i, ye kogono ede eglke pikrabuka. I siragl pre yagl suo Janes ya Jambres okna yegl eribriko, yoba ye du eribredi kanimere yegl, yoba erme ka mabuno kibi digwa i, ama yoba mudu ye du erimedi kanaiglkwa pre ye kogono ede eglke pikrabuka.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti God kamo ake gi di morabuka paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ba na mabuno siragl mere erika i, ene pre kan etnga. Na God kogonmo kaima eragledi prika ya te, ye kamo yoba siragl mere beke teiga i ene kandre, siragl mere mogl pai erika i, ene ama kanga. Te, na God kamo pre medigl moglsre, oglka erekre, dena muduna yoba tedre, yubun ugwa igne adigl gigledi moglka i, ene ama pre kan etnga. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Te, na God kogonmo erimara i, yoba yubun nariko, na giugl prika i, ene ama pre kan etnga. Okna dumo Antiok ya dumo Aikoniam ya dumo Listra moglka igne, yoba yubun nariko, na giugl prika i pre diga. Ba yubun kane kane ugwa igne, Yagl Kade ege ege na ere yugwa.<verse eid="2TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Ana ene pro, yoba ta Krais Jisas yobama moglsre, God mabunomo duglo boramnedi praiglkwa yobamo i, yoba kide ye ere kide ere tenamnedi eribi, yubun inaiglkwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Ba yoba kide ya yoba bakagl teigwa yobamo i, ye mabunono u kide kaima enabuka paugwa. Ye yoba pere bakagl te meglbi, yoba pere i, ama ye bakagl tenaiglkwa.<verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Yoba tau yegl eraiglkwa ba ene ka tau bekidre, kaima pamedi pre pogl singa i, duglo bogl pai moratnga paugwa. I siragl pre no yoba tau God kamo ene beke tomgo, ene pitnga i, ene no kaima dimedi kan pogl singa. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Te, ene ama pitnga, ene gak kebra mogl, yakinga igne, ene God kamo bogl atne edigwa i prisre, yake ede unga. God kamo i, ene nomane togo, ene Krais Jisas pre mediglngo, ye ene ere yugwa i, kuno erukwa.<verse eid="2TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />God kamo ta bogl atne edigwa paugwa i, God yene yoba nomane togo, ye ka mudu i bogl atne edigwa. Te, God kamo mudu i, nono ka beke norabuka kuno kaima erukwa. God kamo i, nono ka beke norsre, aglau ta erumga i di pogl norsre, te, mabunono kugl dugwa i ake du ede norsre, nono mabuno du eraiglmedi di norukwa pre wakai kaima paugwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Te, God kogonmo yoba nomane wakai idre, kogon wakai mudu eramnedi ake kun eraiglkwa i, God kamo i mina eraiglkwa kuno erukwa.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Timoti God kamo yoba di te pai morabuka paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />God ya Krais Jisas gumuglnomugl ene ta eratnedi ka gigledi di tenaglka i, Krais Jisas ye yoba kor meglkwa ya geglkwa jasno mogl, okuo ede nogugl udre, king morabuka paugwa pre <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />ene ege ege, God kamo di nogugl ede te pai moglo. Ege wakai mo ege kide yenabuka i, di pai moglsre, yoba aglau eraiglkwa i, ene ka tedre, mabunono ake du ede tedre, adigl gigledi moraiglmedi God kamo kuno ere beke to. Te, tabre pre ikribi, ene oglka erekro.<verse eid="2TI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />I siragl pre ege ta unabuka i, yoba ta ka mabuno pamere dinaiglkwa i, yoba prakiure, yene ka siragl mere pramnedi primere mere, yoba ka yegl mere beke noraiglmedi i makai sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Ye ka kaima paugwa i, kide kodidre, ka gua gua, kubu kaman mere yegl panabuka i, di tebi, praiglkwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Yoba tau yegl eraiglkwa ba ene ta eratnga paugwa i, ene nomanen mina taragl kane kane pre pogl sidre, te, yubun unan, adigl gigledi pai moratnga paugwa. Te, ene God kamo wakai yogwa i, yoba di te moglsre, God ene kogon togwa i, ere kodinatnga paugwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol goraglka magigl erumedi prie dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ene pro! Yoba nigl wain i pi toide ede, God teimere mere yegl, yoba na bormaina toide edibi, na goglsre, ede God moglmara enaglka i, ede magigl u kodugwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />God kuda wakai ta eratne dugwa i, na ersre, resis ta ama eratne dugwa i, ere kodidre, God kamo pre medigl mogl pai moglka. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Yegl pre erme Yagl Kade prais ta inatnedi yei narukwa i, bitno gagl mabuno du ersre inaiglkwa i, yei narukwa. Prais yegl mere i, nono Yaglno Kade ye jas du moglkwa i, egemo unan, bitno gagl i narabuka pre diga. Ba prais i, na swara ta ikraglka ba yoba ira ta ye unabedi kwie ere meglkwa i bogl akie inamga.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti Pol moglmara tabre wo dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Ana erme we, ene na moglmara tabre unagledi ero. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />I siragl pre yagl Demas ye erme makandigle wakai morabuka i we di prisre, na kide kodo, ede dumo Tesalonaika ogwa. Te, Kresens ye ede provins Galesia ogo, Taitus ama ede distrik Dalmesia ogwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11-12" />Te, yagl Tikikus, ye ede dumo Efesus enabedi na dedigo, ede ogwa. Luk swara na moglmara mogl pai moglkwa. Te, ene unatnga igne, yagl Mak auro idre wo. I siragl pre ye kogon mina ake ple di narabuka moglkwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Ene unatnga igne, na ir gaglna ta dumo Troas, yagl Karpus moglmara ediga i, idre, wo. Te, na bukna tau yogwa i ama idre, unatnga. Bukna mudu idre unatnga, ba buk tau agl bugla nagino mina beglkwa yogwa i, na ka kaima inagledi prika pre ene buk i idre, unatnga paugwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Yagl Aleksander, ye taragl bras mina bekidre, topo bogl nogwa yagle moglkwa i, na ere kide ere narukwa pre Yagl Kade ye na mabuno ere narumere mere yegl, ere te ikne edenabuka. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Yagl i, ye okna nono God kamo dumga i, si kegl dinagledi kogon podo erukwa yagle kra. Erme ene ama ye pre kan kun ero.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Ana kere moknayene na kot mina adigl, kana diga igne, yoba swara ta adigl mogl, na kana dikrikwa. Ye pra pra na kide kodo, teke ede eigwa. Ye erikwa i, kide erikwa ba na God agle di prika i, ye mabuno kide erikwa i, kide kodo tenabedi pre agle di prika. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Na kot mina adiglka igne, yoba ta na kana dikrikwa ba Yagl Kade yene na moglmara mogl narsre, yobuglo bogl nare, laion na kaglsre, na ere si dinabedi na ere yugwa mere yegl paugwa. I siragl pre ye prukwa i, na ye kamo diga i, ede eglke pi kodinan, yoba yugobuno pere pere, Juda yoba ta moglkrikwa i, mudu praiglmedi prukwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Te, yoba mabuno kide kane kane ere naramnedi eraiglkwa i, Yagl Kade ama na ere i pai moglsre, na suglna wakai mogl enan, okuo ye heven ibo king morabara i, na i suna edenabuka. Ye kagie kade aimadi kamin inabuka paugwa. Kaima.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Ana ene Prisila ya Akwila di tedre, Pol wakai we di tomiwe do. Te, Onesiforus nem agiglema bogl ama yegl di to. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erastus ye dumo Korin mogl pai moglkwa. Te, Trofimus, ye kide sugwa pre na ye dumo Miletus morabedi kide kodo, ede wiga. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ir erabuka igne i okuo yenabiwa, ene tabre ede na moglka unagledi ero.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Yubulus ya Pudens ya Linus ya Klodia ye agroma mudu ta meglkwa i bogl, ene wakai we di teigwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Yagl Kade ene kian mina motnara mogl tedre, ene ere wakai ere te pai morabedi prika.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>